[1.227929, "o", "\n\u001b[38;5;118mTrace SSH wheel ownership\u001b[11;64H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[1.307889, "o", "railmux ssh — agent-pane wheel served locally, not forwarded upstream:\u001b[12;64H"]
[1.325991, "o", "1. handle_terminal_part gets the SgrMouseEvent and dispatches to LocalHistoryView.wheel.\u001b[13;64H"]
[1.344119, "o", "2. wheel() resolves the pane via _route_at; a hit on an agent viewport scrolls _HistoryViewport.offset and returns HistoryAction with render_histor\u001b[14;64Hy=True and forwarded_input=b\"\" — no upstream input.\u001b[15;64H"]
[1.362212, "o", "3. apply_history_action only sends upstream when action.forwarded_input is set; empty means nothing reaches tmux. The overlay is painted client-sid\u001b[16;64He via surface.paint_overlays.\u001b[17;64H"]
[1.37978, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[1;63H\u001b[38;5;70m│\u001b[2;63H│\u001b[3;63H│\u001b[4;63H│\u001b[5;63H│\u001b[6;63H│\u001b[7;63H│\u001b[8;63H│\u001b[9;63H│\u001b[10;63H│\u001b[11;63H│\u001b[12;63H│\u001b[13;63H│\u001b[14;63H│\u001b[15;63H│\u001b[16;63H│\u001b[17;63H│\u001b[18;63H│\u001b[19;63H│\u001b[20;63H│\u001b[21;63H│\u001b[22;63H│\u001b[23;63H│\u001b[24;63H│\u001b[25;63H│\u001b[26;63H│\u001b[27;63H│\u001b[28;63H│\u001b[29;63H│\u001b[30;63H│\u001b[31;63H│\u001b[32;63H│\u001b[33;63H│\u001b[34;63H│\u001b[35;63H│\u001b[36;63H│\u001b[37;63H│\u001b[38;63H│\u001b[39;63H│\u001b[40;63H│\u001b[41;63H│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[17d"]
[1.380321, "o", "4. This is a fast-client history overlay over bounded snapshots, not tmux copy-mode; the implementation notes stock tmux WheelUpPane would enter co\u001b[18;64Hpy-mode, which is deliberately avoided.\u001b[19;64H"]
[1.39846, "o", "Focused test: tests/test_fast_full_window.py::test_local_history_routes_sidebar_immediately_and_owns_agent_wheel asserts agent_action.forwarded_inp\u001b[20;64Hut == b\"\".\u001b[21;64H"]
[1.41706, "o", "Suggested addition: assert agent_action.render_history is True, proving the overlay rendered rather than merely dropping the event.\u001b[22;64H"]
[1.434754, "o", "\n\u001b[38;5;70m✓ Read-only analysis complete · transcript 58f46732e1c4\u001b[24;64H\u001b[38;5;244m› Captured once; sanitized transcript replay; no provider session persisted.\u001b[25;64H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
