[6.03719, "o", "presentation_for_geometry() selects the projection from geometry with hysteresis.\u001b[14;128H"]
[6.055344, "o", "From WorkspacePresentation.WIDE it enters COMPACT when either dimension is cramped:\u001b[15;128H width < COMPACT_ENTER_WIDTH (80) or height < COMPACT_ENTER_HEIGHT (24).\u001b[16;128H"]
[6.073443, "o", "76x30: width 76 < 80, so it returns COMPACT even though 30 rows clear the height ga\u001b[17;128Hte.\u001b[18;128H"]
[6.091549, "o", "160x38: 160 ≥ 80 and 38 ≥ 24, so it stays WIDE with sidebar plus agent. COMPACT_EXI\u001b[19;128HT_WIDTH/HEIGHT (84/26) only applies once already compact.\u001b[20;128H"]
[6.109615, "o", "Existing focused test: tests/test_agent_workspace.py::test_compact_presentation_use\u001b[21;128Hs_two_dimensional_hysteresis pins both width and height behavior.\u001b[22;128H"]
